  "ingredients": [
    "4 skinless, boneless chicken thighs",
    "0.5 cup soy sauce",
    "0.5 cup ketchup",
    "0.33333334326744 cup honey",
    "3 cloves garlic, minced",
    "pinch of salt",
    "1 teaspoon cornstarch",
    "1 tablespoon water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jSv1AAcUhpch0TPhOB05mw7QWu4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-236609-HoneyGarlicSlowCookerChickenThighs-DDMFS-Step-01-e4cdf387596a4d6a8e4edde0cee355f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236609/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange chicken thighs in a single layer in the bottom of a 4-quart slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dPHuyc7PL3xtexWZW_BUV9YJImg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-236609-HoneyGarlicSlowCookerChickenThighs-DDMFS-Step-02-172637e0d81c409c99240698d007ff57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236609/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk low-sodium soy sauce, ketchup, honey, garlic, and a pinch of salt together in a bowl; pour over chicken thighs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SmRMUtJumrj1tak0fL2S3-GsSgs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-236609-HoneyGarlicSlowCookerChickenThighs-DDMFS-Step-03-1-8a2ddf80e70f4c92a15263df5a5a0eab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236609/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low for 4 hours or on High for 2 to 3 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HdadaRDVIM8JZkHMyLa_KQWJqsM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-236609-HoneyGarlicSlowCookerChickenThighs-DDMFS-Step-04-32dc9c716233463e8a865c5999d05e48.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236609/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cornstarch and water together in a small bowl to make a slurry; stir into the sauce. Cover and cook on High for about 15 minutes more, until sauce thickens slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve chicken with sauce spooned over the top. Enjoy!",
